From: Saphira packaging <recipes@saphira.vm2.uk>
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: minimum-required first, floor 3.10

cmake_minimum_required() must precede project(); a 2.8.12 floor
trips CMake deprecated warnings (removal announced for <3.10).
3.10 keeps the existing policies (recipe also passes
-DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5) while silencing the warning.

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
-project (OONF C)
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.8.12 FATAL_ERROR)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.10 FATAL_ERROR)
+project (OONF C)
